cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its data, please cite it as below."
title: "llm-polarization: dyad harness for LLM-to-LLM political dialogue"
abstract: >-
  A harness for running seeker/mentor dialogues between locally served LLMs, administering
  pre/post survey batteries to the mentor, and scoring persona adherence offline, with
  hash-pinned models, chat templates, prompts and seeds on every logged row.
authors:
